OL,3,GNEWSAUS drinks giant completes purchase
OL,4,Aof viral Au Vodka brand for #300m
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS drinks giant Sazerac said it has
OL,7,F"big plans" for Au Vodka after
OL,8,Fcompleting a takeover reported to value
OL,9,Fthe Welsh business at about #300m.
OL,11,FThe Swansea-based vodka brand, known
OL,12,Ffor its gold packaging and viral social
OL,13,Fmedia campaigns, was founded by friends
OL,14,FCharlie Morgan and Jackson Quinn in
OL,15,F2015.
OL,17,FWith investment from DJ Charlie Sloth
OL,18,Fit enjoyed rapid growth before being
OL,19,Fformally acquired by one of the world's
OL,20,Flargest spirits companies.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
