OL,3,GNEWSAUS drinks giant completes purchase
OL,4,Aof viral Au Vodka brand for #300m
OL,5,
OL,6,FFinancial terms have not been
OL,7,Fdisclosed, but the Reuters news agency
OL,8,Freported the deal values Au Vodka at
OL,9,Fabout #300m ($405m).
